      "name": "mcp__evimed__geo_write",
      "source": "mcp",
      "description": "Write this 循证 GEO project. questions saves original rows with a measurement contract; preview_questions previews rows. start_diagnosis measures a saved version. recover_diagnosis retries failed cells once: reuse requestKey on retry; set acknowledgeUnknown only after the user explicitly accepts a possibly billable call that may duplicate a delivered request. Read diagnosis_progress first. value merges by id; research queues work after this run.",
